{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "dbfd21df-baa7-8904-ad26-ff2516112f42",
  "created_at": "2025-12-17T10:10:06-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Mike Lynch",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T10:07:11-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T10:07:14-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good morning, Denise. My name is Mike Lynch. I am calling about water in my yard. The rain today is heavy, and it is coming down the hill from the next street and straight into my property."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T10:07:29-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I'm sorry to hear that. What's the address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T10:07:33-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "474 Ruggles Avenue, in the Historic Hill. The water comes off the street above, runs along the edge, and then it comes through my yard. On the other hand, the drain at the corner looks fine to me, but I cannot say for certain."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T10:07:51-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. And is it getting into the house, or is it staying in the yard?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T10:07:58-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Only the yard for now. Excuse me one moment, I am putting a lid on a container here and, ah, it pops. There. I have it. So, yes, the yard only."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T10:08:11-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem. Is it pooling, or is it moving like a stream?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T10:08:16-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is moving, like a small stream. I have taken photographs this morning. On the other hand, maybe you do not need them, but I can send them if that is useful."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T10:08:29-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "They'd help, yeah. I can put a note on the request and give you where to send them. Let me ask first, has anyone from the city worked on that street lately, do you know?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T10:08:43-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That is actually my question. When did they last come by? I have not seen a crew, but on the other hand I am not home all day."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T10:08:55-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I don't have the cleaning dates in front of me from here. I'll write it into the request so the drain crew can tell you when they were last on that block. Can I get a good callback number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T10:09:11-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, 401-555-0189."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T10:09:13-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0189, perfect. Mike Lynch, 474 Ruggles Avenue, runoff coming down from the street above into the yard, photos available. Did I get that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T10:09:23-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That is exactly right. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T10:09:26-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Crews are stretched during a storm like this one, so it may not be today. If it starts coming toward the house, call right back and say so."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T10:09:37-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. And the photographs, where do I send them?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T10:09:41-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hang on, let me get you the right spot for that. [pause] Okay, I'll have someone from the office call you back with the way to send them, since they'll be the ones working the request."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T10:09:56-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That is fine. I will wait for the call, then."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T10:10:01-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sounds good, Mr. Lynch. Stay dry."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T10:10:04-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, Denise. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
